    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahazi kūbiza ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gw'ikūmi na mpungatī aho Peka ng'witūnja o ng'wa Lemalia alī ntemi wa Isilaeli, Ahazi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yotamu ūbiza ntemi wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahazi walī na myaka makūmi abīlī aho alandya kūbiza ntemi; ūtema ikanza lya myaka ikūmi n'ītandatū alī mu Yelusalemu. Ū wei atītile yawiza ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wakwe, gīt'ūmo walī wītīla nkūlūgenji wakwe Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Washimīzīlaga mu nzīla ja batemi ba Isilaeli; nose ūūkabīta na kūpemba ng'witūnja wakwe mu moto, kūlwa kūlondeela nhūngwa ja mahanga ayo SEEBA walī wagapeeja gīkī gabīngīle a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wafunyaga shitambò na kūzuukīja būbbani kū mapandī ga higūlya, kū ngūlū, na mu mbeho ja mitī ya madūūtū manīlīzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna Lezini ntemi wa Alamu na Peka ntemi wa Isilaeli, būnsanga ū Ahazi kwiza kwīdumīla ī Yelusalemu, būmpīndīlīja na mabità gabo; gwike būlemeelwa ū kūng'heeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ū Lezini ū ntemi wa Alamu ūgūshosha mu būsugi wa Alamu ū nzengo gwa Elasi, ūbapeeja a banhū ba Yuda abo bikalaga moi. Baedomu būsaamīla ī Elasi, na kūshisha lelo īyī balī bikaji ba ng'wenūmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahazi ūtūma banhū kūlī Tigilasi-pilesa, kūjūng'wīla, “Ū nene nalī ntūmami wako, na nalī ng'witūnja wako. Nangūhīlage wize ūnigune ū mu makono ga ntemi wa Alamu nū wa Isilaaeli, nguno banūbūkīlile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahazi ūjisola ī feza nī zahabu ījo jikilonga ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, nū mu mabīkīlo ga sabo ga ng'wikūlū, ī shose shenīsho ūntwalīla inong'ho ū ntemi wa Ashulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Ashulu ūzunya ū kūngunanha ū Ahazi; ūtwala mabità gakwe Damasiko kūgūdumīla ū nzengo gwenūyo, kūshisha ūgūdima. A bikaji ba ng'wene ūbasaamīja Kili, ū Lezini ūmūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya makanza ū Ahazi ūja ī Damasiko kwibona nū Tigilasi-pilesa ū ntemi wa Ashulu; aho alī Damasiko ūbona koi ng'walīlo; ūntwalīla ū ngabīji Ulia shiikolanīgījo shago ū ng'walīlo gwenūyo, kūng'olekeja ūmo gūlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ngabīji Ulia ūbeeja ng'walīlo gwa kūbiza gīt'ūmo shalī ī shiikolanīgījo īsho ntemi Ahazi akantūmīla kūfuma Damasiko; ūgūmala aho ataalī kūshoka ū ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi aho washoka kūfuma ī Damasiko ūshikīla kūgūlola ū ng'walīlo gwenūyo, wegeela ūfunya shakwinha a higūlya yago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūfunya hoi ī shitambò shakwe sha kūpemvwa, nī sha būsu, wita hoi na shakwinha sha kūng'wiwa; na a mininga ga shakwinha shakwe sha būsangī ūgaseeseebela a ha ng'walīlo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'walīlo gwa shaba ūyo gwalī gwīmīīlile kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA ūgwīnja ū kū būtongi wa hekalu, ūgūsaamya aho gwalī, a ha gatī gatī ya hekalu nū ng'walīlo gwakwe; ūgūtūūla kū sukuma ya ng'walīlo gwakwe ū mpya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū ntemi Ahazi ūnagīj'ū ngabīji Ulia ūhaya, “Ī shitambò sha kūpemvwa ī sha dilū, nī shakwinha sha būsu ī sha mhīndī, bizagūshifunya a ha ng'walīlo ū mpya; pyī nī shitambò sha kūpemvwa ī sha ntemi, nī shakwinha shakwe ī sha būsu, nī shitambò sha kūpemvwa ī sha banhū bose ū mu sī īyī, nī shakwinha shabo sha būsu, nī shakwinha shabo ī sha kūng'wiwa. A mininga ga shitambò sha kūpemvwa na a ga shitambò; a gose ūkūyūgaseeseebela a ha ng'walīlo gwenūyo. Ū ng'walīlo gwa shaba nakūyūgūtūmamīla nene kūlwa kūbūūja mbika ja kajīle.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji Ulia wīta gīt'ūmo akalagīīlīlwa na ntemi Ahazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi Ahazi ūshīnja ī shipande sha chūma īsho shalī shibbadanīkīgije kūlwa kūdimīīla madandali, nī shiseme īsho shalī a ha makīndīkīlo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makīndīkīlo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "A makīndīkīlo genayo gaalī gadūgije kūsaamiwa, kūfuma ipandī īlī kūja ipandī līngī; na 25:13,16.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nī nyanza wīyīnja a ha migongo ya nzagamba",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nzagamba:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shiikolile sha nzagamba.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ja shaba, aho yalī ītūūlile; wītūūla h'ikīndīkīlo ly'iwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shalīho na chumba sha kwifuulīla shalī shizengilwe haho nī hekalu hūna shūbimvwa chiza chiza, nasho ūshīnja; walīho na būbītīlo wa ntemi ajile na kūfuma mu hekalu, nū wene ūwīnja ī hanze ya hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA; ī yose yenīyī akīyīta kūlwa nguno ya ntemi wa Ashulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Ahazi yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Yuda; ī yose īyo wīyīta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahazi wifuula na bakūlūgenji bakwe, ūjīkwa hamò nabo mu nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi. Ng'witūnja wakwe Hezekia ūbiza ntemi a ha ng'wanya gwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
